          "tex": "\n\\frac{U_n(\\theta_*)}{\\sqrt n}\\xrightarrow{d}Z,\n\\quad Z\\sim N_m(\\boldsymbol0,\\mathcal I),\n\\qquad M_n\\xrightarrow{p}\\mathcal I.\n",
